Well, I checked.  And I must say that I was very disappointed at the lack of
Chaotic weapons/artifacts.  Only 2 of each.  (Stormbringer & Grimtooth, and
Master Key of Thievery & Palatir of Westernesse.)  There were _plenty_ of
Neutral & Lawful items, though.  Seems really unbalanced to me.

On the cool side, my character (level 30 rogue--Thief) has a Master Key of
Thievery.  Due to his -16 AC and having >1 screenfull of attributes, I never
noticed until I checked the code that one property of the MKofT is to cut
all physical damage received by 1/2!
One thing that puzzles me about it, though, is that the MKofT also has the
ability to speak.  So sez the code.  It's never said anything to me.  I've
tried #chatting with it but that won't do anything.  Me & the Master Assassin
(the quest nemesis) exchanged a few words, but I don't recall the Key ever
saying anything.  What is this "item can speak" attribute all about?
